  "Description": {
    "Cost": 3056715,
    "UIName": "Warhammer LAM WHM-LAM-QSK",
    "Id": "mechdef_warhammer_lam_WHM-LAM-QSK",
    "Name": "Warhammer WHM-LAM-QSK",
    "Details": "Everyone knows a LAM should just shoot and scoot, and here at QuicSell, we make that easy. Picking up a great deal on some Warhammer LAM parts, we decided to focus on an often ignored segment: periphery Heavy-LAM use. Knowing that you can't always find a machine shop, the Warhammer LAM QS comes with a patented hardwood frame originally seen on the 'Spruce Goose' WiGE, allowing even the most basic worlds to provide structural repair. Focusing on that initial impulse of damage, we've swapped out the dangerous ammo-laden missiles for everyone's favorite! Rockets! These are coupled with a pair of LBX PPC's to ensure better accuracy on strafing runs, as well as a modest bomb bay that we stock with even more rockets.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_warhammer"
  },
